<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13216] QuerySqlField annotation&apos;s &quot;name&quot; property is not used during validation of known fields names</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13216</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If &quot;name&quot; parameter is set it should be used instead of actual field name. Currently if 2 @QuerySqlField fields have same names we will receive error, even if they have different &quot;name&quot; properties.	&lt;/p&gt;</description>
